      "title_at_amendment": "Rib tests.",
      "text": "(a) Rib tests must simulate the conditions in the airplane with respect to-- (1) Torsional rigidity of spars; (2) Fixity conditions; (3) Lateral supports; and (4) Attachment to spars. (b) The effects of ailerons and high lift devices must be accounted for.",
